=== Ternary Cryptography Demo ===

--- Trit Hash ---
  Input:  27-trit word
  Digest: 27-trit hash
  Hash[0..2]: - - 0

--- Trit HMAC ---
  Key:  all +1
  HMAC[0..2]: + - -

--- Symmetric Cipher ---
  Plaintext[0..2]:  + 0 -
  Ciphertext[0..2]: + 0 -
  Recovered[0..2]:  + 0 -
  Round-trip: 27/27 trits match

=== Crypto demo complete ===
